{"title":"Adventure","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"terra-fit-smart-watch","title":"Terra Fit Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"599\"\u003eThe Terra Fit Smartwatch is designed for active lifestyles that demand reliability, smart connectivity, and everyday comfort. With Bluetooth calling support, health tracking essentials, and a durable sporty build, Terra Fit helps you stay connected, track your fitness, and manage daily tasks effortlessly—whether you’re working out, commuting, or unwinding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"899\"\u003eBuilt around a practical full-touch display and powered by a single-chip Bluetooth calling system, Terra Fit delivers smooth performance with essential smart features that matter most. Its long battery life, water resistance, and fitness-focused tools make it a dependable companion for daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":51181307920662,"sku":"22850","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":44679171735830,"sku":"18564","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":44679171768598,"sku":"18577","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":44679171703062,"sku":"18576","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":44679171834134,"sku":"18575","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Olive Green","offer_id":44679171801366,"sku":"18578","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_df601d00-3118-441f-ac86-ce5b8f69a31a.webp?v=1776933536"},{"product_id":"z811-earbuds","title":"Z 811 Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eMeet your all day audio companion with the best selling Z811 Earbuds giving you upto 50 Hours of Playtime, IPX5 Water Resistance with Quad Mic ENC, giving you the best in class features in a sleek flip design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Z 811\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZ811 Earbuds: Your Ultimate Audio Companion\u003cbr\u003eExperience unparalleled sound quality and comfort with the Z811 earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e: Enjoy up to 50 hours of playtime on a single charge.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCrystal-Clear Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our 13mm bass drivers deliver exceptional HD sound quality, ensuring you hear every detail of your music.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e: With Quad Mic ENC, enjoy crystal-clear calls and meetings without background noise interference.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstant Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our Bluetooth 5.3 technology ensures instant pairing with your device, so you can start listening right away.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e: Get 120 minutes of playtime in just 10 minutes with our fast-charging technology.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComfortable Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e: The Z811's lightweight and ergonomic design provide a comfortable fit for all-day wear.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Construction\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our IPX5 water resistance rating ensures your earbuds can withstand sweat and light rain.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStylish Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: Choose from our dual-toned soft matte rubber finish in multiple colors to match your style.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Easily activate your device's AI voice assistant with simple touch controls or voice commands.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Experience lag-free gaming with our 40ms low latency mode.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBreathing LED Lights\u003c\/strong\u003e: Add a touch of style with our breathing LED lights.\u003cbr\u003eUpgrade your audio experience today with the Z811 earbuds.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Z811\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50 Hours Total Playback\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdaptive Low Latency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Playback: 50 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFast Charging: 10min Charge = 120min Playtime Charging Port: C-type\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Indicator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMode Quad Mic Environmental Noise Cancellation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSound\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDriver: 13mm Audio codec: AAC, SBC High Fidelity Acosutics\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBT Version: 5.3 BT supported profile: A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, HSP Compatibility: Android \u0026amp; iOS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWater resistance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdded Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHyperbass™ Technology, 13mm Drivers | SBC, AAC Codec Supported\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Z811\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Z811 is the most reliable choice for your earbuds in the industry with a sleek design packed with audio leading features. It’s IPX5 Water Resistance ensures that your in-ear companion stays with you in every terrain with a battery life that lasts as long as you do!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"White","offer_id":46203584643350,"sku":"18544","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":46203584381206,"sku":"18510","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/811-white-1.webp?v=1733300591"},{"product_id":"ninja-smart-watch","title":"Ninja Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the rugged Ninja Smart Watch: 1.78\" AMOLED, Always-on Display, BT Calling, \u0026amp; Military Grade Protection. Tough tech for active lifestyles!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eNinja Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ninja Smartwatch combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek, modern design. Ideal for those who seek both functionality and style, this smartwatch helps you stay connected, monitor your health, and enhance your daily activities.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re at work, the gym, or out for the evening, the Ninja Smartwatch seamlessly fits into any lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Ninja Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ninja Smartwatch is packed with features to keep you ahead of the curve. Monitor your fitness with precision through its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected effortlessly with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media updates, all accessible on a high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always powered up, while customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps let you personalize your look to match any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Ninja Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Ninja SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpting for the Ninja Smartwatch means choosing a device that enhances your life with its superior functionality and sleek design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and stylish aesthetics make it a top choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, with dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Camou Green","offer_id":46921441116438,"sku":"19635","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":46921441083670,"sku":"19636","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":46921441018134,"sku":"19633","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green","offer_id":46921441050902,"sku":"19634","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/nin_blk.webp?v=1717769452"},{"product_id":"luna-smart-watch","title":"Luna Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eSwitch towards infinite possibilities with the Luna Smartwatch, styled through a cosmic full metal body with a 1.39” HD Display and IP67 Water Resistance. With a fully functioning AI Assistant, Luna keeps you connected at every moment. Strap into the future of smartwatches with Active Weather Forecasting, BT Calling, and sleek strap designs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.39” HD Display\u003cbr\u003eIP67 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003eActive Weather Forecasting\u003cbr\u003eBT Calling\u003cbr\u003eSmart Notifications\u003cbr\u003eActive Health Suites\u003cbr\u003eWorkout Modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatches\u003c\/a\u003e and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47069797450006,"sku":"20081","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":47069797548310,"sku":"20080","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069797515542,"sku":"20084","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Gold","offer_id":47069797482774,"sku":"20077","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48148570308886,"sku":"20680","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Sporty Gray Rings","offer_id":48926634311958,"sku":"22477","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Sporty Red Rings","offer_id":48926630936854,"sku":"22479","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Luna-_5_3.webp?v=1776510284"},{"product_id":"carbon-earbuds","title":"Carbon Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eCarbon Earbuds with super loud sound and Environmental Noise Cancellation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eCarbon Earbuds Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover unparalleled sound quality with Carbon Earbuds. These earbuds are designed for those who seek both high-performance audio and comfort. Ideal for any activity, Carbon Earbuds deliver an outstanding listening experience whether you're on the go or at home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Carbon Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCarbon Earbuds provide rich, immersive sound with enhanced bass and clear treble. With built-in noise reduction, you can enjoy your music without interruption.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe lightweight and ergonomic design ensures a secure and comfortable fit, while touch controls allow for easy music and call management. The long-lasting battery life ensures you stay connected longer, and the sleek charging case provides additional power for extended use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Carbon Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 hours (up to 28 hours with charging case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Time: 1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNoise Cancellation: Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaterproof Rating: IPX5\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 50g (with case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Carbon Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuantum Earbuds provide exceptional sound quality and comfort, making them the perfect choice for any audio lover. With advanced features like noise cancellation and long battery life, these earbuds stand out in the market. The sleek and modern design adds a touch of style to your audio experience, making them suitable for any setting. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":48768395870486,"sku":"20392","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Dark Green","offer_id":48768395903254,"sku":"20482","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Light Gray","offer_id":48768395936022,"sku":"20480","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/JX98-01.webp?v=1765806286"},{"product_id":"phantom-pro-smart-watch","title":"Phantom Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStrap in to endless possibilities with the Phantom Pro Smartwatch, featuring three Pro Straps designed for the active and never-ending lifestyle. Powered by a 2.04” HD Display with an Always On Display, the Phantom Pro showcases 100+ Pro Smartwatch Faces, an Active Health Suite, 100+ Workout Modes, and a 5 Day Battery for extended performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Phantom Pro:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 Adventure Ready Straps\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2.04” HD Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlways On Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eActive Health Suite\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100+ Workout Modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5 Day Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Phantom Pro:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatches \u003c\/a\u003eand earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Magnetic Blue Orange","offer_id":48942209958166,"sku":"20726","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Magnetic Marsala Orange","offer_id":48942213726486,"sku":"20725","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Ocean Blue Orange","offer_id":48942222213398,"sku":"22183","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Ocean Gray Orange","offer_id":48942222246166,"sku":"20727","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray Nylon","offer_id":48942222147862,"sku":"20728","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Magnetic Black","offer_id":48942213759254,"sku":"22174","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Ocean Black Orange","offer_id":48942222278934,"sku":"22178","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Nylon","offer_id":48942222115094,"sku":"22180","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Nylon","offer_id":48942222180630,"sku":"22176","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/BLACKNYLON_1.webp?v=1723464184"},{"product_id":"wave-pro","title":"Wave Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"53542514-04a7-447c-b6a1-c81cd58127bc\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro Earbuds represent the next generation of in-ear audio, delivering an unparalleled HD sound experience with over 100 hours of playback time. As the industry's first powerhouse earbuds with such longevity, Wave Pro stands out with 5 dual-toned, soft matte finishes, seamlessly blending superior audio performance with cutting-edge style that perfectly matches your fashion sense.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features of Wave Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro offers an industry-leading 100 hours of playback time, powered by 13mm Bass Drivers that deliver crystal-clear HD sound. Equipped with Quad Mic ENC, the earbuds ensure premium call quality and effective noise cancellation, even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Bluetooth 5.3 and Insta-Pair technology, the Wave Pro connects to your device instantly, and a quick charge of just 10 minutes provides 120 minutes of playback. The lightweight, ergonomic design with rounded monochrome tips ensures all-day comfort, while the soft matte, dual-tone rubber finish adds both style and enhanced grip for easy carrying.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro also features AI Voice Assistant with touch controls for seamless hands-free operation. Whether you're using \"Hey Siri\" for iOS or \"Ok Google\" for Android, activating your assistant is as easy as tapping or holding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Wave Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlayback Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDrivers\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13mm Hyperbass™ Tech\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLatency\u003c\/strong\u003e: Adaptive Low Latency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Playback\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 10-minute charge = 120 minutes of playtime\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Port\u003c\/strong\u003e: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Indicator\u003c\/strong\u003e: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quad Mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSound\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDriver Size\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Codecs\u003c\/strong\u003e: AAC, SBC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Fidelity Acoustics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSupported Profiles\u003c\/strong\u003e: A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, HSP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility\u003c\/strong\u003e: Android \u0026amp; iOS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHyperbass™ Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Wave Pro?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro merges fast fashion with disruptive technology. Boasting the largest battery capacity in the industry, superior sound quality, and a sleek dual-tone matte finish, these earbuds are a perfect balance of performance and style. The Wave Pro isn’t just an accessory—it’s a reliable companion that elevates both your listening experience and your sense of style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Flame Orange Black","offer_id":49286916931862,"sku":"22481","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Gray","offer_id":49286910017814,"sku":"22539","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lilic Gray","offer_id":49286909985046,"sku":"22615","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":49286909952278,"sku":"22613","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":50027537662230,"sku":"23070","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Ecommerce-Image-1.webp?v=1729196999"},{"product_id":"wave-neo-earbuds","title":"Wave Neo Earbuds","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"53542514-04a7-447c-b6a1-c81cd58127bc\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeet the Wave Neo Earbuds, designed to blend advanced technology with stylish looks. They come in Moon Brown, Forest Green, Steel Gray, and Lilac Purple colors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Neo Earbuds deliver great sound quality using Bluetooth 5.3. They support AAC and SBC audio formats and have dual microphones for clear calls. They're also built to resist water splashes (IPX4) and feature easy touch controls for quick pairing and voice assistant access. Gamers will appreciate their low delay of just 45 milliseconds. Plus, they offer up to 20 hours of total playtime with the charging case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize and Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds: 33.5 x 21.3 x 23.5mm, Charging Case: 58.1 x 47.99 x 30.00mm, Weight: 38.2g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds: 40mAh, Charging Case: 360mAh, Charging Time: 1.5 hours, Total Play Time: 20 hours, Playing Time: 6 hours, Standby Time: 40 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWireless Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bluetooth 5.3, Range: 15 meters, Supports: HFP V1.5, A2DP V1.3, AVRCP V1.3, HID V1.0, Auto Pairing: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFunctionality:\u003c\/strong\u003e Touch Control (with 7 sensitivity levels), Dual Silicon Microphone ENC for noise reduction, Audio Formats: SBC, AAC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Wave Neo:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Neo Earbuds are all about great sound, stylish design, and user-friendly features. They're perfect for everyday listening or getting into your favorite games with minimal delay. With their sleek look and easy touch controls, these earbuds fit seamlessly into modern lifestyles, offering both performance and style in one package.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":49492874166550,"sku":"22432","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":49492874232086,"sku":"22641","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Steel Gray","offer_id":49492874199318,"sku":"22639","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Lilac Purple","offer_id":49492874264854,"sku":"22640","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/7_2.webp?v=1736756569"},{"product_id":"display-earbuds","title":"Display Earbuds","description":"\u003ch3\u003eDisplay Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle combine cutting-edge technology with sleek design, offering superior sound, unmatched comfort, and innovative smart features. Whether you’re looking to elevate your music, calls, or gaming experience, these earbuds are designed to meet every need, offering the ultimate in wireless freedom.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Display Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElegant Design Meets Everyday Comfort\u003c\/strong\u003e: Available in four stunning colors—Black, Blue, Green, and Champagne. Designed for a snug and secure fit, offering unmatched comfort even during extended use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Sound Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e: High-definition audio decoding with a quad-microphone ENC system for premium sound quality in music and calls, even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Smart Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e: Built into the charging case for easy browsing, managing, and customizing settings. Select wallpapers, music, set timers, and more on a single screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnboard Storage\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 minutes of onboard audio storage allows you to enjoy your favorite tracks anywhere, anytime, without a phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-Day Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: 6 hours of playtime on a single charge, 30 hours total with the charging case. Fast-charging technology ensures a full charge in just 1 hour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.4 with Popup Pairing, Auto-Pairing, and Hyper Sync technology for lag-free performance up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow-Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ultra-low latency of 50–60 ms for smooth and responsive gameplay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e: Simple gestures for play\/pause, volume control, skip tracks, activate Siri\/Google Assistant, and enter Game Mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for Your Active Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e: IPX4 water resistance rating for workouts, light rain, or everyday adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Display Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Black, Blue, Green, Champagne.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio\u003c\/strong\u003e: High-definition audio decoding, quad-microphone ENC system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: 6 hours playtime on a single charge, 30 hours total with case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 hour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.4, Popup Pairing, Auto-Pairing, Hyper Sync technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e: Settings customization, battery status check, wallpaper selection, music browsing, timers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Control\u003c\/strong\u003e: Play\/pause, volume control, skip tracks, Siri\/Google Assistant activation, Game Mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Rating\u003c\/strong\u003e: IPX4.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Accessories\u003c\/strong\u003e: Display Earbuds, charging case with interactive smart screen, custom-fit eartips, USB charging cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Zero Lifestyle Display Earbuds?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Display Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle combine premium performance with cutting-edge features and effortless style. Offering all-day comfort, hassle-free pairing, low-latency gaming, and a customizable smart screen, these earbuds are designed to enhance every moment of your day. Whether you’re streaming, gaming, or enjoying music on the go without your phone, the Display Earbuds provide the ultimate in wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Metallic Black","offer_id":49791717409046,"sku":"23206","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Metallic White","offer_id":49791608783126,"sku":"23204","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Metallic Blue","offer_id":49791608717590,"sku":"23200","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Metallic Green","offer_id":49791608684822,"sku":"23198","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Metallic Beige","offer_id":49791608750358,"sku":"23202","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/brown.webp?v=1741777839"},{"product_id":"edge-smartwatch","title":"Edge Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Edge Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight construction (22g) with a sturdy PC+ABS finish.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid TFT Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch screen with a resolution of 240×284 pixels.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days of regular use and up to 35 days on standby. Quick charging in under 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Burned Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManage calls, messages, and notifications directly from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control for snapping moments.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Find Phone\" feature for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator, and motion gesture for screen activation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary, drink water, and hand wash reminders.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch TFT screen with 240×284 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days regular use, 35 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Less than 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 9+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 with 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Edge Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Edge \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003edelivers a harmonious blend of functionality and style. With advanced health tracking, seamless connectivity, and practical everyday tools, it fits right into your lifestyle. Whether you're working, exercising, or relaxing, the Edge Smartwatch enhances every moment with its innovative features and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49894865142038,"sku":"22878","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49894865174806,"sku":"22879","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":49894865109270,"sku":"22943","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49894865240342,"sku":"22945","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49894865207574,"sku":"22944","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/B1_218495a9-8f36-4abf-b51a-64671c0db56e.webp?v=1767865748"},{"product_id":"storm","title":"Storm Headphones","description":"\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Storm Headphones\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Storm Headphones are equipped with a robust 750mAh battery, delivering up to 70 hours of continuous playback at 60% volume and an impressive standby time of up to 6000 hours. A full recharge takes just 2–3 hours, ensuring your music experience remains uninterrupted.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBluetooth 5.0 Connectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience seamless wireless audio with Bluetooth V5.0 technology, offering a stable connection within a 10-meter range. The dual pairing feature allows you to connect and switch effortlessly between two devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSimple Pairing Process\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo pair, press and hold the Multi-Function Button (MFB) for 3 seconds until the LED indicator flashes red and blue, signaling pairing mode. Select \"Storm\" from your device's Bluetooth menu and enter “0000” if prompted. Once paired, the headphones will automatically reconnect to the device when in range.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHands-Free Convenience\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eControl your music and calls with intuitive touch features. Play\/pause, answer\/reject calls, skip tracks, and adjust volume—all at your fingertips. Activate Siri or Google Assistant by holding the MFB for 2 seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWired Option Available\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSwitch to wired mode using a 3.5mm AUX cable to conserve battery. Inserting the cable disables wireless functions, offering greater versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAudio Quality \u0026amp; Calling\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e40mm drivers deliver dynamic sound with a frequency range of 20Hz–20KHz and 32Ω impedance. The built-in microphone with -38dB±3dB sensitivity ensures clear calls and voice assistant interaction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCharging Indicator\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging via micro-USB is straightforward. A red LED lights up while charging and turns off once the battery is fully charged.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.0\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70 hours (at 60% volume)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6000 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2–3 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 750mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Drivers:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32Ω\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20Hz–20KHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes (Siri \/ Google Assistant)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAUX Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes (3.5mm cable)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Indicator:\u003c\/strong\u003e Red LED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 181g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black, Blue, Champagne\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose Storm Headphones?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Storm Headphones offer a powerful audio experience, extended battery life, dual Bluetooth connectivity, and smart touch controls in a sleek, stylish package. Whether you're streaming music, taking calls, or using voice assistants, these headphones adapt effortlessly to your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50007641194774,"sku":"22913","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50724668408086,"sku":"24048","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":50007641227542,"sku":"22914","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red","offer_id":50724668440854,"sku":"24142","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50007641162006,"sku":"22912","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"White","offer_id":50007641260310,"sku":"22915","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/black_1_bdf97883-4dd7-4609-8119-aae71f0f5e9c.webp?v=1747123777"},{"product_id":"striker-earbuds","title":"Striker Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSleek and Dynamic Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted for style and comfort, the Striker Earbuds are available in three bold color choices—Black, Green, and Camo.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds measure 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePortable Charging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimensions of 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total weight of just 48.9 g, ensuring a comfortable fit for extended use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy uninterrupted performance with a robust battery setup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 27.5 hours in total, with approximately 5.5 hours of continuous playback at 70% volume.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully recharges in about 2 hours via a Type-C input (1W for the case, 0.5W output).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Batteries:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by Jingshan Yifan Energy Co., Ltd. with an earbud battery capacity of 35mAh and a case capacity of 400mAh.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Duration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds last about 60 days; charging case lasts up to 120 days.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience effortless pairing and uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth V5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e for stable connections.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity within \u003cstrong\u003e≥10 meters\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHassle-Free Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Supports \u003cstrong\u003eautomatic pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e for an effortless user experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Low-latency performance with \u003cstrong\u003e65ms response time\u003c\/strong\u003e for immersive gaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch \u0026amp; Voice Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy easy management with sensitive touch controls.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay\/Pause:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single tap on either earbud.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCall Handling:\u003c\/strong\u003e Answer with a tap, double-tap to hang up, long press (2–3 seconds) to reject.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Activation:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eleft earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for Siri or Google Assistant.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eright earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for a low-latency experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFactory Reset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tap \u003cstrong\u003efive times\u003c\/strong\u003e while pairing L \u0026amp; R, then place them in the case and remove to confirm reset.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Audio Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmerse yourself in powerful sound clarity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Drivers:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e13mm audio drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e deliver a frequency range of \u003cstrong\u003e20Hz–20kHz\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Sensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e111.5±3dB\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures balanced sound performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClear Calls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with a \u003cstrong\u003e2718 silicone microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e for superior voice capture.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI ENC Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enhances call noise reduction for crisp conversations.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Certified \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e for protection against splashes and light rain.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 48.9 g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e About \u003cstrong\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eV5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, supports multiple protocols\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eSBC\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMicrophone:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single MIC\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Control:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully responsive interface\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds (Left \u0026amp; Right)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReplaceable Eartips\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose the Striker Earbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for those who demand excellence, the Striker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle bring together cutting-edge technology and a modern aesthetic. Whether you're making calls, gaming, or enjoying music, these earbuds are built to elevate your lifestyle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gaming Black","offer_id":50894617641238,"sku":"24765","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming Camou Beige","offer_id":50938794901782,"sku":"24763","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50050472968470,"sku":"22916","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Beige","offer_id":50050472870166,"sku":"22942","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":50050472902934,"sku":"22917","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming Camou Gray","offer_id":50938794934550,"sku":"24764","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50050472935702,"sku":"23083","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming-Forest Green","offer_id":51218551669014,"sku":"24872","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stoc