powered through busy days with a reliable battery system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"823\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"823\"\u003eExtended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of working time and up to 15 days on standby.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"898\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"900\"\u003eQuick Recharge:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully charges in just 2.5–3 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"957\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"959\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"980\" data-start=\"959\"\u003eReliable Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery with Seiko board protection for long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"1104\"\u003eEnjoy smooth pairing and stable connections for all your smart functions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with BLE 5.3 for fast, reliable transmission.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1272\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1293\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003eGenerous Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1336\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003eSmart Notifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay on top of calls, messages, and app alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1551\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eAdvanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1480\"\u003eTake charge of your health with comprehensive monitoring features.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1593\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1596\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO₂) \u0026amp; Blood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1650\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–08:00)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1689\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1728\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003eBreath Training \u0026amp; Stress Function\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1731\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1789\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003ePedometer, Calories, Sedentary \u0026amp; Hydration Reminders\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1792\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e8 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including walking, running, cycling, swimming, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003eGPS Motion Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Via connected mobile app for precise activity mapping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2054\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1997\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003eSmart Controls \u0026amp; Customization\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2000\" data-start=\"1997\"\u003ePacked with features that make everyday life easier.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2103\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003eBluetooth Phone Calls \u0026amp; AI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2106\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2134\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003eCamera \u0026amp; Music Control\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2181\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003eWeather Forecast (Today + Next 6 Days)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2184\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2205\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003eDIY Watch Face:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize with your favorite photos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2245\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2303\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003eStopwatch, Countdown Timer, Calculator, Split Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2306\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003eMulti-Language Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including Arabic, German, Japanese, Chinese, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2393\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2417\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003eFun Gaming Feature\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2458\" data-start=\"2426\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38\" TFT, 240×240 resolution\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2520\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2546\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2566\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2581\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2597\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e BLE 5.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2638\" data-start=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2638\" data-start=\"2610\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2631\" data-start=\"2610\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2639\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2641\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2641\"\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 8 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2701\" data-start=\"2678\"\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2702\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2724\" data-start=\"2702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2724\" data-start=\"2704\"\u003eOrbit 2 Smartwatch\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2725\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2727\"\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2744\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2746\"\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2806\" data-start=\"2766\"\u003eWhy Choose the Orbit 2 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3082\" data-start=\"2807\"\u003eDesigned for modern, active lifestyles, the Orbit 2 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatches by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/a\u003e blends advanced health monitoring, smart connectivity, and rugged durability. Whether you’re working out, staying productive, or just staying connected, the Orbit 2 is built to elevate your day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":50061363872022,"sku":"23116","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50061363773718,"sku":"22808","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Coffee","offer_id":50061363839254,"sku":"23108","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50061363806486,"sku":"23110","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Marsala Gold","offer_id":50061363904790,"sku":"23112","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Golden","offer_id":50061363937558,"sku":"23114","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/silver_4_35749c97-d365-44fc-aa24-b7b94532fa1a.webp?v=1776755793"},{"product_id":"arcade-beast","title":"Arcade Beast","description":"\u003ch2 data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"109\"\u003eArcade Beast by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"134\"\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"168\"\u003eSleek and Tactical Design\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"293\"\u003eBuilt for both performance and style, the \u003cstrong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"227\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e earbuds come in four bold colorways—Black, Grey, Blue, and White.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"353\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"353\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"315\"\u003eCompact Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds measure 34.3 × 20.4 × 20 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"383\"\u003ePortable Charging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimensions are 58.1 × 45.8 × 27.3 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"441\"\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total weight of just 44.53 g ensures a snug and effortless fit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"557\"\u003eLong Battery Life \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"640\"\u003eGame, stream, and talk all day with powerful battery support and quick recharging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"694\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"694\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"663\"\u003eTotal Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 30 hours of usage time\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"760\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"760\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"724\"\u003eSingle Charge Playback:\u003c\/strong\u003e Around 6 hours at moderate volume\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"815\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"815\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"781\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully recharges in about 1 hour\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"836\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"834\"\u003ePower Setup:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"865\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"865\"\u003eType-C Input: DC 5V\/1A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"892\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"892\"\u003eCase Input Power: 5W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"916\"\u003eCase Output: 1.2W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"939\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"937\"\u003eBattery Specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"960\"\u003eEarbuds: 40mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"979\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"979\"\u003eCase: 400mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003eBattery Manufacturer: Golden Universe \/ Henan Wanli \/ Hunan Lirui\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1071\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 40 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1204\"\u003eStay connected with ultra-reliable Bluetooth and real-time responsiveness.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1269\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1269\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1230\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.4 for faster, more stable pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1332\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1332\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1295\"\u003eConnectivity Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Operates smoothly within 10 meters\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1364\"\u003ePersonalized Device Name:\u003c\/strong\u003e Recognized as “\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"227\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e”\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1448\"\u003eAdvanced Protocols:\u003c\/strong\u003e A2DP 1.4, AVRCP 1.6.2, HFP 1.7.2, and more\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1517\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1515\"\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eAuto Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1556\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1556\"\u003ePopup Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1573\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1573\"\u003eHyper Sync\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003eMaster-Slave Switching\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003eSmart Controls \u0026amp; Voice Activation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1700\"\u003eTake control with effortless taps and voice commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1724\"\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Activate Siri or Google Assistant with four taps on the left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1865\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1865\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1819\"\u003eTouch Interaction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully responsive interface for easy control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1899\"\u003eQuick Pairing \u0026amp; Smart Sync:\u003c\/strong\u003e Pair instantly without digging into settings\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1985\"\u003eImmersive Audio \u0026amp; Durability\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2038\"\u003eEngineered for powerful sound clarity and endurance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2116\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2062\"\u003eDriver Platform:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by JL 7006F8 chip for clean, balanced audio\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2152\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2152\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2136\"\u003eAudio Format:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2176\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Splash-ready for daily wear (IPX rating not specified)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2269\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2295\"\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 34.3 × 20.4 × 20 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2373\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2373\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2349\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 58.1 × 45.8 × 27.3 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2403\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2403\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2393\"\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 44.53 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2433\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2433\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2424\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1 hour\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2465\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2465\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2458\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2521\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2521\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2489\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40mAh (earbud), 400mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2542\"\u003ePlayback Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6 hours (single charge), 30 hours total\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2609\"\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2650\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2650\"\u003eArcade Beast Earbuds (Left \u0026amp; Right)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2668\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2668\"\u003eCharging Case\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2692\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2692\"\u003eReplaceable Eartips\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003eType-C Charging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2751\"\u003eWhy Choose Arcade Beast?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"3019\"\u003eLevel up your lifestyle with \u003cstrong data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2798\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e—a bold fusion of form, power, and real-time audio performance. Built for gamers, streamers, and go-getters, these earbuds are your companion for every battle, beat drop, and call. Plug in. Lock on. Beast Mode: Activated.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Stealth Black","offer_id":50134811410710,"sku":"22932","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Thunder Blue","offer_id":50134811443478,"sku":"22936","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Convert White","offer_id":50134811377942,"sku":"22934","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gaming black","offer_id":51154447302934,"sku":"25001","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ECOM_01.webp?v=1774945163"},{"product_id":"legacy-smartwatch","title":"Legacy Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"119\"\u003eLegacy Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"140\"\u003eThe Legacy Smartwatch combines modern utility with timeless design, engineered to elevate your everyday life. From powerful health tracking features to customizable aesthetics, this smartwatch is built for users who demand performance, comfort, and a touch of class — whether at work, in the gym, or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"460\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"487\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"487\"\u003eRefined \u0026amp; Robust Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: 44mm zinc alloy + plastic case, 56g weight with IP67 water resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"587\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"589\"\u003eVibrant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e: Sharp visuals on a 1.39\" screen with brightness adjustment and always-on support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"699\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"701\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"701\"\u003eLong Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days standby with a quick 2-hour charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"801\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"803\"\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"844\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"870\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"872\"\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"902\"\u003eSpO2 Level Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"928\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"930\"\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"951\"\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1008\"\u003eCalorie Tracker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1026\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e120+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: Covers activities from running and cycling to yoga and beyond.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1114\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e: Stay updated with call alerts, messages, reminders, and app notifications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1216\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003eVoice Assistant Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Compatible with voice assistants for hands-free commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1309\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003eInteractive Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13 dynamic faces, including 6 animated and full DIY customization.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1407\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003eEntertainment on Wrist\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in game (\"Plane\") for quick play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1479\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003eDaily Essentials\u003c\/strong\u003e: Alarm, weather, flashlight, calculator, sedentary reminder, drink water prompt, camera control, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1615\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: AMOLED, 1.39-inch, brightness adjustable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003eBattery\u003c\/strong\u003e: 400mAh lithium battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1742\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003eUsage Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days regular, 25–30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003eCharging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 2 hours via magnetic suction\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate (HRS3605), SpO2, Blood pressure, Accelerometer (LIS2DOCTR)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1933\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1951\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003eSports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: 120+ activities supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1981\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.2, 20m range, supports calls, contacts, call records\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2068\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Google Assistant, Siri compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2127\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2138\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003eGames\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2153\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003eOther Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e: Flashlight, alarm, weather, calculator, camera control, DND mode, motion gesture activation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2266\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e: IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2303\"\u003eWhy Choose the Legacy Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2342\"\u003eThe Legacy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis more than just a wearable — it’s a lifestyle upgrade. Designed with precision, equipped with cutting-edge features, and built to last, it’s the perfect companion for health tracking, productivity, and staying connected. Whether you're chasing goals or winding down, Legacy adapts to your day — strong, smart, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":50200306778390,"sku":"20778","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50200306745622,"sku":"20779","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Blue","offer_id":50200306811158,"sku":"22173","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/GoldBlack_2.webp?v=1765658265"},{"product_id":"snap-zbuds","title":"Snap Zbuds","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"20\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"18\"\u003eSnap Zbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"306\"\u003eThe Snap Zbuds are engineered for music lovers and multitaskers who want powerful sound, effortless controls, and all-day comfort. With immersive audio, long-lasting battery, and seamless connectivity, Snap Zbuds are your go-to earbuds for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"311\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"346\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"344\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"454\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"383\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; Lightweight Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic earbuds with a sleek charging case for easy portability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"560\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"478\"\u003eImmersive Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e – 12 mm dynamic drivers with SBC and AAC decoding deliver rich, balanced sound.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"681\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"590\"\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"610\"\u003e7 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e of playtime on a single charge and \u003cstrong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"664\"\u003e29 hours total\u003c\/strong\u003e with the case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"778\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"716\"\u003eQuick Charging \u0026amp; USB‑C Port\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"747\"\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"891\"\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with 10 m range, quick auto‑pairing, and master‑slave switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1023\"\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"920\"\u003eClear Calls Anywhere\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual MEMS microphones with ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) for crystal‑clear conversations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1064\"\u003eTouch Controls \u0026amp; Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Play\/pause, switch tracks, and activate Siri\/Google Assistant with simple taps.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1224\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1179\"\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built to withstand sweat and light rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1229\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1266\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1264\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 27.39 × 25.01 × 23.02 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1351\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 66 × 43.7 × 32 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1385\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30.42 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1419\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50 mAh (earbuds) + 480 mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1471\"\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7 hours (single charge) \/ 29 hours (total)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1568\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours via USB‑C\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1613\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (10 m range)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1647\"\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Jieli7016\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1679\"\u003eAudio Driver:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12 mm dynamic driver\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1728\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20 Hz – 20 kHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1762\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 16 Ω\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1788\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 112.5 ± 3 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1827\"\u003eDecoding Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC, AAC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1857\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dual MEMS Mic\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1899\"\u003eNoise Cancellation:\u003c\/strong\u003e ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1964\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4 (splash‑proof)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"1991\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2025\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2023\"\u003eWhy Choose Snap Zbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2409\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eSnap Zbuds are more than just wireless earbuds—they’re your all‑day companion for calls, music, and workouts. With powerful audio, reliable ENC for clear calls, and a compact design, they’re built for every moment. Whether you’re commuting, hitting the gym, or just unwinding, Snap Zbuds keep you connected and entertained without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Lavender Haze","offer_id":50335110660374,"sku":"23427","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Cool Grey","offer_id":50335110627606,"sku":"23425","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":50335110693142,"sku":"23426","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Lavendar-Haze_2.webp?v=1771238203"},{"product_id":"luna-pro","title":"Luna Pro","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLuna Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch blends modern design with powerful health and lifestyle features, delivering a premium experience for everyday life. With advanced sensors, fitness tracking, and a customizable interface, Luna Pro keeps you connected, informed, and in control—wherever your day takes you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy middle frame with PC plastic bottom case and anti-static z\u003cspan\u003einc alloy frame\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.38-inch TFT round screen with 240×240 resolution and full-screen touch support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – 220 mAh polymer battery provides \u003cstrong\u003e5–7 days of regular use\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e10–15 days standby\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e via magnetic USB cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, notifications, music control, and remote camera function.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–8:00)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Supports walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, and swimming, with GPS motion tracking via the \u003cstrong\u003eDaFit app\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – 4 pre-installed dials, 1 DIY custom face, and more available in the watch face market.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Assistant \u0026amp; Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e – AI voice assistant, alarm, calculator, stopwatch, weather updates, sedentary and drink reminders, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – \u003cstrong\u003eIP68 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, making it safe for daily use and light water exposure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy frame + PC bottom + silicone strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38-inch TFT, 240×240 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e JIELI 7012F6\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e RAM 640 KB \/ ROM 64 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e LC09 heart rate sensor, Minghao DA267 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220 mAh polymer battery (5–7 days use, 10–15 days standby)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3, supports calls, music control, notifications\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, swimming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApp:\u003c\/strong\u003e DaFit (Android 5.0 + \/ iOS 9.0 +)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtra Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e AI voice assistant, remote camera, DIY watch face, split‑screen, built‑in game, OTA updates\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Luna Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch is designed for users who demand performance, style, and versatility. From \u003cstrong\u003ehealth monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e to \u003cstrong\u003esmartphone connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e, it combines everyday convenience with fitness intelligence. With customizable watch faces, extended battery life, and IP68 water resistance, Luna Pro is more than a smartwatch—it’s your all‑day companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50337766244630,"sku":"23118","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":50337766277398,"sku":"23120","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/BLACKWATCHFACE.webp?v=1755331884"},{"product_id":"zenith-headphones","title":"Zenith Headphones","description":"\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Contains:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1 device, 1 user manual, 1 warranty card\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith Headphones\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith blends premium sound engineering with timeless design, giving creators and travelers the ultimate immersive audio experience. Built for long journeys, creative sessions, and everyday use, Zenith combines powerful performance, extended playtime, and versatile functionality in a sophisticated form.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmersive Acoustic Experience\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith features a unique acoustic chamber effect that creates a deep, studio-like immersive sound environment around the listener. The result is rich, immersive sound that enhances focus and creativity anywhere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExtended Playtime\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith up to 70 hours of battery life, Zenith is designed to support long creative sessions, travel days, and continuous playback without frequent charging.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDual Pairing\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConnect two devices simultaneously to seamlessly switch between tasks, such as editing on a laptop and taking calls on a smartphone, without manual reconnection.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIndependent SD Card Slot\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith allows music playback directly from an SD card, enabling users to enjoy their playlists without relying on a phone or external device.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExternal Speaker\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSwitch from private listening to speaker mode to share music and sound with others, transforming Zenith into a compact portable speaker.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePremium Design and Build\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith features an over-the-ear cup design for extended comfort, fingerprint-resistant finishes, and a quality-build steel headband. It is available in three sophisticated colors: Chocolate Brown, Midnight Blue, and Charcoal Black.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTravel Friendly\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith’s foldable-design is perfect for those who are always on-the-move, fitting seamlessly into travel setups and airport looks while providing reliable performance throughout long journeys.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e High-grade plastic body with steel headband extension and matte finish earcups\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBattery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 800 mAh polymer lithium battery with up to 70 hours of playback time\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Bluetooth 5.3, SD card slot, dual pairing support\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Type-C charging\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAudio:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 40mm sound drivers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWeight:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Approx. 250 g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eColors:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Chocolate Brown, Midnight Blue, Charcoal Black\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecial Features:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Up to 70 hours playtime, Dual pairing, Independent SD card slot, upto 45MS low latency, external speaker mode, immersive chamber sound, 300-day standby time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose Zenith Headphones\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eZenith is more than just a pair of headphones; it is an immersive studio experience on-the-go. Whether working on the go, traveling, or seeking inspiration, Zenith delivers a powerful and sound experience with exceptional endurance and versatility. Its blend of premium design, extended playtime, and multi-mode functionality makes it the ideal choice for creators, travelers, and the acoustic chamber is perfect for anyone who refuses to compromise on sound quality.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch1 data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"576\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Carbon Black","offer_id":50550060548374,"sku":"22650","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50550060613910,"sku":"22930","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Chocolate Brown","offer_id":50550060581142,"sku":"22931","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Zeinth-CarbonBlack_7.webp?v=1773045674"},{"product_id":"evo-earbuds","title":"Evo Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEVO Earbuds\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds bring a bold new edge to sound and style. With a sleek metallic finish, powerful 10 mm drivers, and dual-mic ENC for crystal-clear calls, EVO is designed for those who live loud and make every beat their own. Built to match Gen Z energy, it’s where performance meets personality.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePremium Metallic Design – Glossy metallic casing with bold color options. \u003cbr\u003eLightweight 36.5 g build for everyday comfort and portability.\u003cbr\u003ePowerful Sound Performance – 10 mm dynamic drivers deliver balanced bass and crisp treble.\u003cbr\u003eENC Voice Clarity – Dual-mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) ensures clear calls even in noisy environments.\u003cbr\u003eBattery Performance –\u003cbr\u003eEarbuds: 40 mAh each (approx. 5–6 hours playtime)\u003cbr\u003eUp to 50 Hours total play time.\u003cbr\u003eCharging Type – Type C\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Connectivity – Bluetooth 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eSmart Touch Controls –\u003cbr\u003ePlay\/Pause: Single-tap MFB button\u003cbr\u003eNext Track: Double-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003ePrevious Track: Double-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume +: Triple-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume –: Triple-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003eVoice Assistant (Siri \/ Google): Press and hold 2 s\u003cbr\u003eAnswer \/ Hang up Call: Single-tap MFB\u003cbr\u003eReject Call: Long-press 2 s MFB\u003cbr\u003eTurn Off: Press and hold 4 s\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance – IPX4 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Case Dimensions: 60.1 × 48.36 × 26.6 mm\u003cbr\u003eWeight: 36.5 g (total)\u003cbr\u003eBattery Capacity: Earbuds 40 mAh each \/ Case 400 mAh\u003cbr\u003eTotal Playtime: 50 hours\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Range: 10 m\u003cbr\u003eDriver Size: 10 mm dynamic drivers\u003cbr\u003eMicrophones: Dual mic + ENC \u003cbr\u003eControls: Smart Touch (MFB multi-function buttons)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose EVO Earbuds?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds are engineered for those who thrive on individuality. With their metallic build, punchy 10 mm drivers, and ENC-enhanced voice clarity, EVO ensures your music and calls always sound as good as you look. Designed for expressive, everyday use. It’s not just another pair of earbuds, it’s your sound, your style, your EVO.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50630768132374,"sku":"23463","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50630768197910,"sku":"23470","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50630768165142,"sku":"23464","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ruby Red","offer_id":50630768230678,"sku":"23468","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50630768099606,"sku":"23466","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/evo_jet-back_3.webp?v=1776686260"},{"product_id":"aero-earbuds","title":"Aero Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Contains:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1 pair of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/earbuds-zbuds\"\u003eearbud\u003c\/a\u003e, 1 charging cable, 1 user manual, 1 feature book, 1 warranty card\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero brings the essence of Zero Lifestyle’s sound engineering into a lighter, more compact form. Designed for creators, commuters, and everyday listeners, Aero delivers studio-grade clarity, seamless connectivity, and comfort that stays with you all day. Whether you’re in the zone, on the go, or winding down, Aero blends performance and elegance for the modern audio experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e13mm Boosted Super Driver\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero is powered by a 13mm boosted sound driver that enhances every beat with rich depth and crisp detail, creating a balanced audio experience that brings your playlists, calls, and podcasts to life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eENC Function with Quad Mic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) and a Quad Mic setup, Aero ensures your voice stays crystal clear during calls, even in noisy surroundings. Ideal for remote work, content creation, and everyday communication.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntegrated AI voice support lets you control music, manage calls, and check updates effortlessly, all through simple voice commands without reaching for your phone.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith just \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e45ms latency\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, Aero’s gaming mode synchronizes sound and visuals in real-time for uninterrupted gameplay and a competitive edge.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero connects instantly the moment you open the case; no delays, no manual reconnecting. Smart pairing technology remembers your devices for a seamless start every time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eup to 30 hours of total playtime\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e (including case) and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e5 hours on a single charge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, supported by Type-C fast charging that gives \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e120 minutes of playtime in just 10 minutes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt to handle splashes, sweat, and light rain, Aero keeps up with your workouts and outdoor routines without compromise.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eManage music, calls, and gaming mode with a gentle tap; intuitive touch control ensures zero interruptions in your flow.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 5.4\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBT Range:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 15m\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpeaker Unit:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 13mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 20–10kHz\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 32Ω\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEarbud Battery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 30mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Case Battery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 250mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1.5 hours\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Up to 5 hours on a single charge; 30 hours total with case\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Input:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Type-C, DC 5V 0.3A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBox Input:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e DC 5V 0.3A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e IPX5\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecial Features:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 13mm boosted drivers, ENC with Quad Mic, AI Voice Assistant, Gaming Mode (45ms Low Latency), Instant Pairing, Type-C Fast Charging, 10-min quick charge = 120-min playtime, IPX5 water resistance, Sensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose Aero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds redefine what everyday audio should feel effortless, expressive, and reliable. With immersive sound, powerful noise cancellation, and long-lasting performance, Aero keeps you connected to your rhythm wherever life takes you. From daily commutes to late-night edits, from workouts to work calls, Aero delivers clarity, comfort, and confidence, the Zero way.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Hyper Red","offer_id":51198922490134,"sku":"22281","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51198932222230,"sku":"22270","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Space White","offer_id":51198931665174,"sku":"23064","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Aqua Green","offer_id":51198923211030,"sku":"23063","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":51198931730710,"sku":"23061","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Aero_Hyper-Red-4.webp?v=1766759359"},{"product_id":"navigator-smartwatch","title":"Navigator Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"351\"\u003eNavigator Smartwatch – Precision GPS. Rugged Performance.\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eNavigator \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is built for people who take accuracy seriously — from outdoor explorers to everyday athletes. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"504\"\u003ehigh-precision GPS\u003c\/strong\u003e, advanced health sensors, and a \u003cstrong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"563\"\u003eworking rotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e for ultra-smooth control, Navigator gives you powerful performance in a tough, outdoor-ready design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eSpec - Navigator\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"748\"\u003e🔭 High-Precision GPS Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"889\"\u003eGo further with confidence. Navigator’s \u003cstrong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"827\"\u003eintegrated high-precision GPS chip\u003c\/strong\u003e tracks your route, pace, and distance with accuracy across:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"901\"\u003eWalking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"913\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"913\"\u003eRunning\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"925\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"925\"\u003eCycling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"943\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"943\"\u003eTrail running\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eHiking \/ on-foot exploration\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1016\"\u003eNo phone needed for location tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1021\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1070\"\u003e🎛 Working Rotating Crown + Sport Button\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1104\"\u003eNavigate your watch like a pro:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1125\"\u003eRotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e to scroll menus, switch tiles, and zoom quickly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1209\"\u003eDedicated Sport Mode button\u003c\/strong\u003e for one-tap access to your workouts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003eExtra \u003cstrong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1271\"\u003eHome button\u003c\/strong\u003e for fast control in any situation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003eEven with gloves or sweaty hands, the physical controls keep everything under your command.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1454\"\u003e🌈 290+ Watch Faces \u0026amp; Full Customisation\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1477\"\u003eMake it truly yours:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e5 default watch faces on the watch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1559\"\u003eOver 290+ additional watch faces\u003c\/strong\u003e available in the app\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003eDIY custom dials using your own photos, colours, and styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003eYou can switch looks from sporty to formal in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1755\"\u003e⚡ Magnetic Charging \u0026amp; Long Battery Life\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1820\"\u003eCharging is effortless with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1817\"\u003eincluded magnetic charger\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003eSimply snap the charger to the back – no ports, no hassle\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1903\"\u003e300mAh battery\u003c\/strong\u003e with up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1942\"\u003e3–5 days of typical use\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003eUp to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1978\"\u003e10–12 days on standby\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003eFull charge in about \u003cstrong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2024\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2070\"\u003e🧠 Advanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2123\"\u003eStay on top of your health with precision sensors:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e24\/7 heart rate monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003eBlood oxygen (SpO2) tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003eBlood pressure \u0026amp; stress monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003eSleep tracking with insights\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003eBreath training modes (Relax \/ Fall asleep)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e100+ sports modes with detailed metrics (steps, kcal, duration, MET)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2383\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2427\"\u003e🖥 1.43\" AMOLED Display + Always-On\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2502\"\u003eEnjoy a vivid, sharp view with a \u003cstrong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2499\"\u003e1.43-inch AMOLED display (466×466)\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003eAlways-On Display clock mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003eFull touch control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003eCrisp, bright visuals indoors and outdoors\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2658\"\u003e📞 Smart Features That Keep You Connected\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003eBluetooth calling (dial\/answer\/reject on the watch)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003eApp notifications (social apps, SMS, calls, etc.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003eAI voice assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003eWeather, alarms, timers, stopwatch, world clock\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003eSedentary \/ drink water reminders, goal achievement alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003eRemote camera shutter \u0026amp; music control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003eFind my phone, DND \u0026amp; low power mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"2993\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3016\"\u003e💧 Built Tough\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3038\"\u003eIP68 waterproof\u003c\/strong\u003e – ready for sweat, splashes, and everyday use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3137\