"3000\"\u003e✔ Travel \u0026amp; commute\u003cbr data-end=\"3024\" data-start=\"3021\"\u003e✔ Online meetings \u0026amp; calls\u003cbr data-end=\"3052\" data-start=\"3049\"\u003e✔ Students, professionals \u0026amp; gamers\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50775231463702,"sku":"23386","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":50775231430934,"sku":"23388","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Black","offer_id":50775231496470,"sku":"23391","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Black","offer_id":50775231398166,"sku":"23389","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/blue-black-1.webp?v=1771411142"},{"product_id":"opal-earbuds","title":"Opal ANC Earbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"530\"\u003eDesigned for everyday performance and all-day comfort, these wireless earbuds deliver powerful sound, reliable connectivity, and long battery life in a sleek in-ear design. Available in \u003cstrong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"433\"\u003eBlack, White, Green, and Blue\u003c\/strong\u003e, they combine modern style with advanced audio technology to fit seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"825\"\u003ePowered by an \u003cstrong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"564\"\u003eF11 audio unit\u003c\/strong\u003e and supporting \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"606\"\u003eSBC\/AAC audio decoding\u003c\/strong\u003e, the earbuds produce clear highs, balanced mids, and deep bass for music, calls, and streaming. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"725\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, you get faster pairing, stable connections, and low power consumption for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1105\"\u003eBuilt for convenience, the earbuds feature \u003cstrong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"898\"\u003esensitive touch controls\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"916\"\u003eauto pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"950\"\u003eindependent earbud usage\u003c\/strong\u003e with master-slave switching. Whether you’re answering calls, controlling music, or activating \u003cstrong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1073\"\u003eSiri or Google Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e, everything is just a tap away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1333\"\u003eWith up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e40 hours of total playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003eIPX4 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1208\"\u003elow-latency performance\u003c\/strong\u003e, these earbuds are ideal for daily use, workouts, travel, and casual gaming — offering reliable performance wherever you go.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50996504690966,"sku":"23711","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50996504658198,"sku":"23707","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50996504723734,"sku":"23709","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Opal_Beige-1.webp?v=1775561678"},{"product_id":"qube-smartwatch","title":"Qube Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"489\"\u003eStay connected, active, and in control with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"269\"\u003eQube Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e, designed to blend smart technology with everyday convenience. Featuring a vibrant full-touch display and a sleek, modern design, Qube keeps your notifications, fitness tracking, and health insights right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eBuilt for daily performance, the Qube Smartwatch offers comprehensive health monitoring, smart notifications, and multiple sports modes to support your active lifestyle. Whether you're tracking workouts, managing calls, or monitoring your heart rate, Qube delivers reliable performance with long-lasting battery life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"967\"\u003eWith Bluetooth connectivity, intuitive controls, and a comfortable strap design, Qube is the perfect companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silver","offer_id":51050937254166,"sku":"23888","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":51050937155862,"sku":"23814","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":51050937188630,"sku":"23890","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Rose","offer_id":51050937221398,"sku":"23889","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CHAMPAGNE_01.webp?v=1773019308"},{"product_id":"bolt-pro","title":"Bolt Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"200\" data-start=\"160\"\u003eBolt Pro Smartwatch – Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"348\"\u003eThe ZERO BOLT PRO is a sleek and feature-rich smartwatch designed for everyday fitness, connectivity, and convenience. With its modern square dial and vibrant display, it delivers both style and smart functionality in one powerful wearable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"366\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"394\"\u003e1.83\" IPS HD Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – Large, bright screen for clear and immersive viewing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"487\"\u003eSingle Chip Bluetooth Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e – Make and receive calls directly from your watch\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"611\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"611\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"562\"\u003e100+ Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – Personalize your display to match your style\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"635\"\u003e100+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Track a wide range of workouts and activities\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"750\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"750\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"721\"\u003eDynamic Heart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e – Real-time heart tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"804\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"804\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"772\"\u003eSpO₂ Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e – Monitor blood oxygen levels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"831\"\u003eIP66 Water Resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Protection against dust and water splashes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"955\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"955\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"915\"\u003eQibla Direction \u0026amp; Prayer Times\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built-in Islamic lifestyle features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eTasbih Counter\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient digital counter\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1075\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1075\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1033\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e – Receive call, message, and app alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1095\"\u003eSync Contacts\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy access to saved contacts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1182\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1182\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1159\"\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Hands-free control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1203\"\u003eBuilt-in Games\u003c\/strong\u003e – On-the-go entertainment\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1289\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1289\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1262\"\u003eAlarm, Timer \u0026amp; Stopwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e – Everyday utility tools\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1321\"\u003eUp to 5 Days Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reliable performance on a single charge\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1389\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1417\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1417\"\u003e3D Colorful Dynamic UI\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1439\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1439\"\u003e365 Days Warranty\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003eCompatible with the ZERO Health app (available on App Store \u0026amp; Google Play)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003eMagnetic charging cable included\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1734\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eThe ZERO BOLT PRO combines fitness tracking, smart connectivity, and practical lifestyle tools making it ideal for daily wear, workouts, and staying connected anytime, anywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51061801943318,"sku":"23892","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Vintage brown","offer_id":51068077310230,"sku":"24132","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Graphite Mauve","offer_id":51061801910550,"sku":"24136","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":51061801976086,"sku":"23813","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl Grey","offer_id":51061802008854,"sku":"24134","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Bolt_Black-1.webp?v=1775288200"},{"product_id":"rover-elite-earbuds","title":"Rover Elite Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eRover Elite Earbuds – Power Meets Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience high-quality sound, stable connectivity, and long-lasting battery life with the Rover Elite Earbuds. Built for everyday use, these earbuds offer a perfect balance of performance and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSound Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy clear audio with deep bass and balanced output. With SBC and AAC support, the Rover Elite Earbuds deliver a smooth listening experience for music, calls, and videos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds provide up to 7 hours of playtime on a single charge, with a total of up to 35 hours using the charging case. Fast charging ensures the earbuds are ready in about 45 minutes, while the case takes around 1.5 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with Bluetooth 5.4, the Rover Elite Earbuds ensure a stable and fast connection with a range of over 10 meters. It also supports quick pairing and smooth device switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLow Latency Mode\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith 60ms low latency, these earbuds are suitable for gaming and video streaming, keeping audio in sync with visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCall Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDual microphones with ENC noise reduction help reduce background noise, providing clear voice calls in different environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIPX4 rating makes the earbuds resistant to sweat and light splashes, making them suitable for workouts and outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eControls\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTouch controls allow you to manage music, calls, volume, and voice assistants like Siri or Google Assistant easily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesign\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds feature a lightweight and ergonomic design for comfortable long-term use. Available in Beige, Blue, Green, and Black.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBox Contents\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeft and right earbuds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarranty card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUp to 35 hours total battery life\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth 5.4 connectivity\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow latency for gaming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eENC for clear calls\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComfortable and minimal design\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Shadow Black","offer_id":51123063783702,"sku":"24341","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Moss Green","offer_id":51123063750934,"sku":"24340","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Beige","offer_id":51123063816470,"sku":"24339","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Arctic Sky","offer_id":51123063849238,"sku":"23887","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Rover-blackk-3.webp?v=1774434409"},{"product_id":"flow-earbuds","title":"Flow Zbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"356\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds are built for seamless audio, everyday comfort, and effortless connectivity. Designed for modern lifestyles, they deliver powerful sound, smart controls, and all-day convenience in a compact form.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1sboupi\" data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"17djwzr\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"462\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"410\"\u003ePremium Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Crisp audio with deep bass and balanced clarity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1f21ur0\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"548\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"484\"\u003eNoise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reduces background noise for better focus and clearer calls\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1hwist3\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"632\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"577\"\u003eBluetooth Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast, stable, and instant pairing with all devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1h7h2r3\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"711\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"653\"\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Control music, calls, and functions with a simple tap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"f7ntnc\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"784\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"737\"\u003eBuilt-in Microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e – Clear voice quality for calls and meetings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1sz22y3\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"854\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"809\"\u003eSingle \u0026amp; Dual Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Use one or both earbuds as per your need\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"g5zfhw\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"929\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"874\"\u003eErgonomic Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e – Comfortable and secure for long listening sessions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jsvptw\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"997\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"958\"\u003eSweat-Resistant Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Perfect for workouts and daily use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1v9qucm\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1062\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003ePortable Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy charging anytime, anywhere\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"11djg2n\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extended usage with charging case backup\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1hz4s1p\" data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1162\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"9741mt\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; lightweight design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kbxqf4\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1233\"\u003eAuto-connect after first pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ttuwac\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1290\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iOS \u0026amp; all Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"zb1b6u\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1318\"\u003eCharging cable included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ugwij\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003eEasy to use interface\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1472\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds combine performance, comfort, and convenience — making them the perfect everyday audio companion.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Flame Black","offer_id":51210276012310,"sku":"24419","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gray","offer_id":51210276045078,"sku":"24422","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":51210276143382,"sku":"24423","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","o